# Scacelith - 한국어
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). No plural forms (a single form).
# Register: the usual register of Korean software. Statements in formal polite 합니다체
# (저장되었습니다), instructions in -하세요, confirmations in -하시겠습니까?; buttons, menu entries,
# tabs and titles are noun phrases with no ending (새 게임, 기권, 무승부 제안). The player is never
# named by a pronoun (no 당신 / 너): the subject is left out, and 내 is used for the player's own
# things (내 색, 내 계정). Other players are named with 님 ("{0} 님"), which also gives a fixed noun
# for the particle that follows. Korean has no capitals: titles are plain Hangul.
# Particles: none is written right after a placeholder whose last sound is unknown; a fixed noun is
# put after it ("{0} 칸의", "{0} 주소로", "{0} 계정으로") or the particle is invariant (에, 에서, 의, 까지).
# Terms: see the Korean glossary (체크메이트, 스테일메이트, 기권, 무승부, 기보지, 시간 제한, 레이팅...).

